19298::$$$message_0149_0000_0000$$$::It's getting late.[lr]::
19299::$$$message_0149_0000_0001$$$::Feels a little cold to be sleeping, but I'll manage.[lr]::
19300::$$$message_0149_0000_0002$$$::"...Okay, time to sleep. I don't have anything else to do."[lr]::
19301::$$$message_0149_0000_0003$$$::I snuggle up inside my paltry bedding and close my eyes.::
19302::$$$message_0149_0001_0000$$$::I take a break from the fighting.[lr]::
19303::$$$message_0149_0001_0001$$$::I stop thinking about all the problems plaguing me and rest.[lr]::
19304::$$$message_0149_0001_0002$$$::In this castle far from the city, the fourth night wears on.[lr]::
19305::$$$message_0149_0001_0003$$$::Like an old dog settling down after a long life, I drift off to sleep as always,[lr]::
19306::$$$message_0149_0001_0004$$$::unaware that I'm in death's abyss.ÛþÜº